including 28 narrative text elements
and 10 various kinds of title elements,

153
00:09:31.304 --> 00:09:34.674
including header and title in this case.

154
00:09:35.074 --> 00:09:39.412
So you can see the outputs are not
exactly the same, but they're pretty close.

155
00:09:39.946 --> 00:09:42.682
And so it doesn't
matter whether this document

156
00:09:42.682 --> 00:09:45.418
is represented in PDF form or HTML form,

157
00:09:45.418 --> 00:09:48.487
you'll get almost the
same output and can treat

158
00:09:48.487 --> 00:09:50.890
the documents the same
in your application.

159
00:09:51.424 --> 00:09:54.427
Now that you know how to preprocess
PDF documents,

160
00:09:54.427 --> 00:09:57.430
you can try preprocessing
